%% Synthetic dispatch architectures; example facts and caption are in diagram-frameworks.md.
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Moving a handler mapping out of dispatch code
    accDescr: Both systems route requests to handlers. The fixed dispatcher embeds the mapping in code. The registry-based dispatcher consults a separate registration table, allowing the mapping to change without editing dispatch code.
    subgraph fixedSystem["Fixed dispatch"]
        fixedRequest["Request"] --> fixedDispatch("`**Dispatch**
Mapping in code`")
        fixedDispatch -->|route| fixedHandler["Handler"]
    end
    subgraph extensibleSystem["Registered dispatch"]
        extensibleRequest["Request"] --> extensibleDispatch("`**Dispatch**
Mapping lookup`")
        registry["Handler registrations"] -. mapping .-> extensibleDispatch
        extensibleDispatch -->|route| extensibleHandler["Handler"]
    end
    class registry changed
    classDef changed stroke:#0D9488,stroke-width:3px
